  "title": "Recovering in the Bacta Tank",
  "description": "The empty halls of the palace are blanketed in darkness. Tucked away in a far-off corner sits a sleek white bacta pod. Inside, a familiar-looking figure is submerged and at rest. Boba Fett, the once-fearsome bounty hunter recovers from injuries sustained over the course of the last five years. Flashbacks of another life flood Boba's head. Life on Kamino. His last moments with his father, Jango, on Geonosis. And finally, his escape from the Sarlacc pit into the wastelands of the Dune Sea."
